// Imported by module-parse-noname.cone, and deliberately malformed: a global
// declaration with no name after the permission.
//
// The parser reports it and builds a nameless declaration to carry on with.
// That declaration is still handed to the global-symbol namer, which reads a
// generated name that newVarDclFull never initialized -- so an imported module
// crashed where the same line in the root module exits cleanly, because the
// root module's empty prefix returns before the field is read.
//
// Listed in cases.toml as a support module.

imm = 5i32
